-- title:
--   Reindexing a CFZ certificate by a finite equivalence
-- statement:
--   Let $N\ne0$, fix $\nu:\mathbb Z/N\mathbb Z\to\mathbb R$ and a distinguished face $j$, and let $G,P,Q$ be finite types. If a majorized cut system $S$ over $P$ has a CFZ certificate and $e:Q\simeq P$ is an equivalence, then the reindexed system $S.\mathrm{reindex}(e)$ has a CFZ certificate.
